    "peek\n\t\u0022Answer what would be returned with a self next, without\n\tchanging position.  If the receiver is at the end, answer nil.\u0022\n\n\t| nextObject |\n\tself atEnd ifTrue: [^nil].\n\tnextObject _ self next.\n\tposition _ position - 1.\n\t^nextObject!",
