    "PopUpMenu comment:\u0027I represent a list of items.  My instances are presented on the display screen in a rectangular area.  The user points to an item, pressing a mouse button;  the item is highlighted.  When the button is released, the highlighted item indicates the selection.\n\nInstance Variables:\n\nlabelString\t\u003CString\u003E of menu items\nfont\t\t\u003CStrikeFont\u003E for displaying the characters\nlineArray\t\u003CArray\u003E of integers indicating where lines should be drawn in the menu\nframe\t\u003CQuadrangle\u003E\nform\t\u003CForm\u003E containing the composed paragraph\nmarker\t\u003CRectangle\u003E used to highlight selection\nselection\t\u003CInteger\u003E index into menu items;  if 0, no selection\n\u0027",
    "I represent a list of items.  My instances are presented on the display screen in a rectangular area.  The user points to an item, pressing a mouse button;  the item is highlighted.  When the button is released, the highlighted item indicates the selection.\n\nInstance Variables:\n\nlabelString\t\u003CString\u003E of menu items\nfont\t\t\u003CStrikeFont\u003E for displaying the characters\nlineArray\t\u003CArray\u003E of integers indicating where lines should be drawn in the menu\nframe\t\u003CQuadrangle\u003E\nform\t\u003CForm\u003E containing the composed paragraph\nmarker\t\u003CRectangle\u003E used to highlight selection\nselection\t\u003CInteger\u003E index into menu items;  if 0, no selection\n",
    "PositionableStream comment:\u0027I assume that my contents is an indexable collection and that, in support of accessing the elements of my contents, I can reposition a pointer.  I am abstract in that I do not implement the messages next and nextPut: which are inherited from my superclass Stream.\u0027",
    "I assume that my contents is an indexable collection and that, in support of accessing the elements of my contents, I can reposition a pointer.  I am abstract in that I do not implement the messages next and nextPut: which are inherited from my superclass Stream.",
    "Process comment:\u0027Instance Variables: \n\t\tsuspendedContext\t\u003CContext\u003E activeContext at time of process suspension\n\t\tpriority\t\t\t\t\u003CInteger\u003E partial indication of relative scheduling\n\t\tmyList\t\t\t\t\u003CLinkedList\u003E on which I am suspended\n\nI represent an independent path of control in the system.  This path of control may be stopped (by sending me the message suspend) in such a way that it can later be restarted (by sending me the message restore).  When any one of several paths of control can be advanced, the single instance of ProcessorScheduler named Processor determines which one will actually be advanced partly using my priority.\u0027",
    "Instance Variables: \n\t\tsuspendedContext\t\u003CContext\u003E activeContext at time of process suspension\n\t\tpriority\t\t\t\t\u003CInteger\u003E partial indication of relative scheduling\n\t\tmyList\t\t\t\t\u003CLinkedList\u003E on which I am suspended\n\nI represent an independent path of control in the system.  This path of control may be stopped (by sending me the message suspend) in such a way that it can later be restarted (by sending me the message restore).  When any one of several paths of control can be advanced, the single instance of ProcessorScheduler named Processor determines which one will actually be advanced partly using my priority.",
